From e9373b1c73e4477ab315a0c7b42213dbd625d94d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Serene <syee0035@student.monash.edu>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 16:46:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] i18n: rewrite Malay and Chinese copy in a natural,
 conversational voice
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Rewrites 781 of 869 zh/ms entries in messages.ts so they read the way
Malaysian shop owners talk rather than as literal translations, with a
consistent glossary (进货/盘点/在途库存/有效期; stok sedia ada, tarikh kiraan
stok, pesanan dirancang). Placeholders are unchanged. Updates three test
expectations that asserted the old wording.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J7sMu9y8dph2gjpsqnsfjw
